  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEACE AND BRIGADES INTERNATIONAL FOR INTERNATIONAL PROTECTION OF CENTRAL AMERICAN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to protect the working space of individuals and organisations in Guatemala,Honduras and Nicaragua (in exile in Costa Rica) who face repression due to their activities in defence of human rights, through an international accompaniment programme that is based on the following strategies: (1) physical and psycho-emotional accompaniment; (2) improvement of the protection and security tools and skills of HRDs; (3) advocacy with the international community in Central America and abroad; (4) advocacy with Guatemala and Honduran government authorities.</narrative>
  </description>
